A new learning path for Azure Service Bus has been published. These learning maps help customers navigate and explore the features and capabilities of Azure services. This learning map for Service Bus will guide you through understanding and using Azure Service Bus Messaging and Relay to build connected solutions.

For more information, see the <a href="https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/documentation/learning-paths/service-bus" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Azure Service Bus</a> page.

